{
  "_comment": [
    "Every place this site exists. Embedded verbatim into dist/manifest.json at build",
    "time, which is signed with a Nostr key and anchored into Bitcoin via OpenTimestamps.",
    "",
    "The point: /mirrors/ is a page on the primary, so it dies with the primary. This list",
    "is signed data replicated to IPFS, Arweave and Nostr, so anyone holding ANY copy of",
    "the site can recover the address of every other copy -- and tell whether that list was",
    "tampered with. A mirror index that only lives on the thing it indexes is not a backup.",
    "",
    "Addresses, not gateway URLs. ipns://, ar:// and the npub name the content itself; a",
    "gateway hostname would bake in a third party we do not control and have already caught",
    "rewriting bytes in transit. Clients pick their own gateway. Name resolvers (eth.limo,",
    "sol.site, tez.page) are pointers to these same copies, not copies, so they are not here.",
    "",
    "Keep in sync with mirrors/index.html when a surface is added or retired."
  ],
